### 28.12 创建 GitHub 仓库

1. 在 GitHub 创建 `knowledge-garden` 仓库
2. 推送代码：

```bash
git init
git add .
git commit -m "初始：个人技术数字花园"
git remote add origin https://github.com/你的用户名/knowledge-garden.git
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main
```

